e and can have its own scrollbars.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="56589">frame</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1790766">фрэйм</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12314_1230148_2296695"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application that consolidates a user's voice mail, fax, and email into one mailbox, so that the user only needs to check a single location for messages, regardless of type. The email server is used as the platform for all types of messages, making it unnecessary to maintain separate voice mail and email infrastructures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1230148">UM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2296695">Адзіная сістэма абмену паведамленнямі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12314_1230148_2296701"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application that consolidates a user's voice mail, fax, and email into one mailbox, so that the user only needs to check a single location for messages, regardless of type. The email server is used as the platform for all types of messages, making it unnecessary to maintain separate voice mail and email infrastructures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1230148">UM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2296701">адзіная сістэма абмену паведамленнямі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12314_234514_2296695"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application that consolidates a user's voice mail, fax, and email into one mailbox, so that the user only needs to check a single location for messages, regardless of type. The email server is used as the platform for all types of messages, making it unnecessary to maintain separate voice mail and email infrastructures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234514">Unified Messaging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2296695">Адзіная сістэма абмену паведамленнямі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12314_234514_2296701"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application that consolidates a user's voice mail, fax, and email into one mailbox, so that the user only needs to check a single location for messages, regardless of type. The email server is used as the platform for all types of messages, making it unnecessary to maintain separate voice mail and email infrastructures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234514">Unified Messaging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2296701">адзіная сістэма абмену паведамленнямі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12332_237847_1806284"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A spreadsheet that contains information about a shape; for example, its dimensions, angle, and center of rotation and the styles that determine the shape's appearance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237847">ShapeSheet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1806284">ShapeSheet</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12338_126816_1574051"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Tasks that a user is permitted to perform on a computer system or domain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="126816">user rights</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1574051">правы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12338_315148_1574051"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="defin