nge servers. The Exchange Management Console is based on Windows Microsoft Management Console (MMC) 3.0.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397156">Exchange Management Console</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2296284">Кансоль кіравання Exchange</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14888_125490_1599439"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An address that uniquely identifies a location on the Internet. A URL is usually preceded by http://, as in http://www.microsoft.com. A URL can contain more detail, such as the name of a page of hypertext, often with the file name extension .html or .htm.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="125490">Uniform Resource Locator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1599439">вэб-адрас</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14888_125490_1791642"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An address that uniquely identifies a location on the Internet. A URL is usually preceded by http://, as in http://www.microsoft.com. A URL can contain more detail, such as the name of a page of hypertext, often with the file name extension .html or .htm.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="125490">Uniform Resource Locator</term><termN