 a single shape, using one of five geometric Boolean operations: Union, Combine, Fragment, Intersect, and Subtract.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1626608">Merge Shapes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1865083">зліццё фігур</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31898_1626609_1865084"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables single-click access to top data analysis features such as formulas, conditional formatting, sparklines, charts and PivotTable reports.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1626609">Quick Analysis</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1865084">Хуткі аналіз</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31899_1626610_1860364"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode that is optimized for reading or viewing content and does not support edit functionality.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1626610">Read mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1860364">Рэжым чытання</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="p