Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2254099">макет</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37481_2139121_2254112"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway card that allows the user to select one or more pieces or types of content and change what is selected into a heading.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139121">Header</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2254112">Загаловак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37482_2139122_2254124"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway card that shows individual pieces of content sequentially, allowing forward and backward navigation one piece of content at a time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139122">Slideshow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2254124">Слайды</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37483_2139123_2254125"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway group card that shows individual pieces of content sequentially, as a skeuomorphic stack.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139123">Stack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2254125">Стэк</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37484_2139125_2352666"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The button in Sway that allows for the addition of Headers, Text and Media from the Web or local device, and Layout options at the indicated location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139125">Add content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352666">Дадаць змесціва</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37485_2139126_2271071"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway option button under “Add Content” that allows users to select an office document and import it into Sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139126">Import Document</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2271071">Імпарт дакумента</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37486_2139127_2352677"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu option in Sway under the “Add Content” button that analyzes the user’s Sway to suggest useful content that can be browsed or added as desired.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139127">Suggested Content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352677">Прапанаванае змесціва</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37525_2139445_2352679"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu option in Sway under the “Add Content” button that allows users to upload images, Word documents, or PowerPoint presentations from their computer or mobile device into their Sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139445">Upload Content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352679">Запампаваць змесціва</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37527_2139460_2352675"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway button that allows users to share a sway with other Sway users via social media or Docs.com, add additional authors to a sway, or generate the HTML embed code for a sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139460">Share</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352675">Падзяліцца</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37528_2139461_2281915"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway button that allows the user to change a set of cards into a group of cards.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139461">Group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2281915">Група</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37529_2139462_2254096"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The area on a card that allows a user to make the card’s image a background when clicked on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139462">Background</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2254096">Фон</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masc