rNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2220822">Skype® для бізнесу для iPhone</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38336_2781061_2783795"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A cloud communications service that connects people. Skype for Business Online provides intuitive communications capabilities across presence, instant messaging, audio/video calling, and an online meeting experience that includes audio, video, and web conferencing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2781061">Skype for Business on the web</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2783795">вэб-версія Skype для бізнесу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38337_2219973_2278117"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Skype for Business web app that allows users, even those without a Skype account, to join Skype meeting from their wed browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2219973">Skype for Business Web App</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2278117">Вэб-праграма Skype для бізнесу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38338_2219974_2278119"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A plug-in required for audio, video, and screen sharing during a Skype for Business Meeting</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2219974">Skype for Business Web App Plug-in</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2278119">Плагін вэб-праграмы Skype для бізнесу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38344_2220379_2747684"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The software development process based on the classical spiral model to reduce the number of security-related design and coding defects and the severity of any defects that are left, thus reducing software maintenance costs while increasing reliability of software.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2220379">SDL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2747684">Microsoft Security Development Lifecycle</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38344_2220379_2747692"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The software d