e="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3837_319443_2296445"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A MAPI message that holds the delivery information for a message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319443">message transfer envelope</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2296445">канверт перадачы паведамлення</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3837_320022_2296445"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A MAPI message that holds the delivery information for a message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="320022">MTE</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2296445">канверт перадачы паведамлення</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3838_47370_2296237"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A toolbar that is attached to one edge of the program window. When you drag a toolbar below the program title bar or to the left, right, or bottom edge of the window, the toolbar snaps into place on the edge of the program window.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="47370">docked toolbar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2296237">замацаваная панэль</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38399_2223248_2271072"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway Design feature that allows users to change the navigation and layout model of a particular Sway document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2223248">Structure</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2271072">Структура</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38416_2226110_2230884"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that is installed as part of the MultiPoint role on server and ensures that some MultiPoint configuration settings remain set to keep Windows MultiPoint Server running smoothly.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2226110">Windows MultiPoint Server Repair Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2230884">Сэрвіс выпраўлення Windows MultiPoint Server</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38418_2226112_2230869"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in the Messaging app that detects whether an SMS message is spam, based on its content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2226112">smart blocking</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2230869">смарт-блакаванне</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38419_2227157_2230855"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A keypad that is available in Programmer mode, which allows the user to look at numbers represented as various combinations of 1s and 0s, and to toggle between 1 and 0 for each binary bit to form a new number.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227157">bit toggling keypad</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2230855">двайковая клавіятура</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38420_2227158_2230856"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of thematically related apps, games, music tracks, videos, or other items available for purchase or download in the Store. A thematic group of editorially chosen apps and games for merchandising or marketing purposes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227158">Collection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2230856">Калекцыя</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38421_2227159_2230857"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows the user to select a color and increase or decrease the vibrancy of that color in an image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227159">color boost</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2230857">узмацненне колеру</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38422_2227160_2790837"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu invoked with a shortcut key (Windows + G) when gaming that allows users to take a screenshot, take a 30 second clip of a game, and adjust volume controls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227160">Game Bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2790837">Xbox Game Bar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38422_2227160_2792346"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu invoked with a shortcut key (Windows + G) when gaming that allows users to take a screenshot, take a 30 second clip of a game, and adjust volume controls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227160">Game Bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2792346">Game Bar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38423_2227161_2230863"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The platform on which the operating system runs on form factors other than PCs, tablets, and phones.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227161">IoT</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2230863">IoT</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38423_2227161_2269644"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The platform on which the operating system runs on form factors other than PCs, tablets, and phones.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227161">IoT</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2269644">Інтэрнэт рэчаў</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38423_2268355_2230863"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The platform on which the operating system runs on form factors other than PCs, tablets, and phones.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2268355">Internet of Things</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2230863">IoT</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38423_2268355_2269644"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The platform on which the operating system runs on form factors other than PCs, tablets, and phones.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2268355">Internet of Things</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2269644">Інтэрнэт рэчаў</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38424_2227162_2230867"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A broad set of all the user's local and cloud-based content, including documents, apps, settings, photos, videos, music, and email.  Cortana or Bing can search this content and return it in search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><te