 members and disciplines in the project.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2309123">Scrum</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2575597">Scrum</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39791_2856027_2575597"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An iterative and incremental agile software development methodology for managing product development defining "a flexible, holistic product development strategy where a development team works as a unit to reach a common goal", challenges assumptions of the "traditional, sequential approach" to product development, and enabling teams to self-organize by encouraging physical co-location or close online collaboration of all team members, as well as daily face-to-face communication among all team members and disciplines in the project.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2856027">Agile Scrum</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2575597">Scrum</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3980_37784_1573557"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To acknowledge an action or the value of some data (e.g. password) by definite assurance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="37784">confirm</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1573557">пацвердзіць</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39836_2309204_2655458"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software development approach where developers must first write a test that fails before they write the code to make the test succeed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2309204">TDD</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2655458">распрацоўка на аснове тэсціравання</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39836_2309244_2655458"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software development approach where developers must first write a test that fails before they write the code to make the test succeed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2309244">test-driven development</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2655458">распрацоўка на аснове тэсціравання</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39848_2384090_2385511"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Facebook mobile app that is built and is distributed by Microsoft.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2384090">Facebook for Windows Phone 8.1</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2385511">Facebook для Windows Phone 8.1</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3985_113531_2296631"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A handle that supports sizing an object.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="113531">sizing handle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2296631">маркер змянення памеру</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39850_2312644_2330465"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The UI element in Outlook that when clicked will identify and display email where a user has been explicitly mentioned via the @ symbol in either the email subject or body.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312644">Mentions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2330465">Згадванні</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39851_2312649_2322851"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove a flag.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312649">unflag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322851">зняць пазнаку</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39852_2312651_2322848"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A badge for OneNote which when clicked lets users take notes quickly while using any app on the Android platform.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312651">OneNote badge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322848">Значок OneNote</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39853_2312652_2322620"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The act of going to different places on the Internet, on a particular Web site, in a database, etc. in order to find what you want.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312652">navigation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322620">навігацыя</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39856_2312654_2322849"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to sort and display email based on predefined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312654">Quick Filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322849">Хуткі фільтр</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39856_2312654_2359684"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to sort and display email based on predefined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312654">Quick Filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359684">Хуткія фільтры для спіса паведамленняў</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39856_2357846_2322849"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to sort and display email based on predefined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357846">Quick Filters for message list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322849">Хуткі фільтр</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39856_2357846_2359684"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to sort and display email based on predefined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357846">Quick Filters for message list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359684">Хуткія фільтры для спіса паведамленняў</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39857_2312655_2586951"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that intelligently presorts email across all email accounts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312655">Focused Inbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2586951">Прыярытэтныя ўваходныя</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39858_2312656_2586960"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu selection that allows users to move emails from the focused inbox into the Other category.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312656">Move to Non-Focused Inbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2586960">Перамясціць з прыярытэтных</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39864_2322624_2325767"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The wireless personal area network technology, launched in 2010 and marketed as Bluetooth Smart, used for transmitting data over distances as much as 100 meters. Cost and power consumption are low while maintaining a communication range similar to Bluetooth BR/EDR, the other widely-used version of Bluetooth</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322624">Bluetooth Smart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325767">Bluetooth Smart</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39866_2315181_2321068"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Bluetooth Low Energy device that sends static information, such as location or ID, to devices within its area.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2315181">beacon</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321068">маяк</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3987_141789_1864256"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A placeholder text that included the field character, field type, and instructions, and that that shows where specified information from a data source will appear such that the elements in a field that generate a field's result.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141789">field code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1864256">код поля</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39877_2315966_2321073"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature for maps of the interior of some public places, such as the businesses inside a mall, or the gates, businesses, and other services inside an airport.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2315966">venue map</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321073">план памяшкання</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39878_2316274_2321072"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or characteristic of apps or services made available in an enterprise to help with particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316274">line-of-business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321072">галіновы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39878_2316275_2321072"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or characteristic of apps or services made available in an enterprise to help with particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316275">LOB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321072">галіновы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39880_2320100_2324972"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for PC and Surface Hub that helps you connect a phone or PC to the Surface Hub display, or to another PC. On Surface Hub, it also allows you to switch between devices that are connected to the Surface Hub.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2320100">Connect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324972">Злучэнне</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39881_2320112_2324983"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode in which the UI on the screen slides downward so that the user can reach items that normally would be near the top of the screen with one hand.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2320112">one-handed use</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324983">рэжым працы адной рукой</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39882_2320437_2324973"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for purchasing cellular data that is packaged with cellular enabled Dell devices that include a Microsoft SIM card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2320437">Dell NetReady</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324973">Dell NetReady</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39889_2321509_2324980"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of TV shows that are in the top N% of ratings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321509">Top-rated TV shows</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324980">Найвышэй ацэненыя тэлеперадачы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39890_2321510_2324974"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of items emphasized to the customer through placement on the site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321510">Featured collections</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324974">Вартыя ўвагі калекцыі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39891_2321511_2324977"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To make your search results more relevant by excluding unwanted and extraneous items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321511">refine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324977">удакладніць</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39892_2321518_2324976"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows customers to temporarily connect to available free Wi-Fi hotspots in order to find and buy Wi-Fi services from the Windows Store.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321518">paid Wi-Fi services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324976">платныя паслугі Wi-Fi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39932_2323787_2334697"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To create a sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2323787">sway</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334697">стварыць прэзентацыю Sway</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39933_2323799_2330464"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that lets users link their inbox for one email account with an inbox for another account, so they can see the messages from both accounts in a single place.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><t