ected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2713397">Тэлефонная сістэма</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40310_2345004_2346885"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that ensures that no one at Microsoft can access customer content to perform a service operation without the customer’s explicit approval.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2345004">Customer Lockbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2346885">Абароненае сховішча</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40311_2429250_2592195"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft service that shows users how they spend their work time, including time by categories like meetings, email, focus hours, and after hours work as well as network insights such as top collaborators and contacts with whom users may be losing touch.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2429250">Microsoft MyAnalytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2592195">MyAnalytics</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40311_2588076_2592195"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft service that shows users how they spend their work time, including time by categories like meetings, email, focus hours, and after hours work as well as network insights such as top collaborators and contacts with whom users may be losing touch.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2588076">MyAnalytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2592195">MyAnalytics</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40312_2653175_2655437"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook add-in that provides email statistics such as read percentages, number of forwards, and average reply time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2653175">MyAnalytics Outlook add-in</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2655437">Надбудова MyAnalytics для Outlook</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40315_2345366_2346298"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Universal Windows app that allows a person to add credit cards that can be used to pay for things with their phones using NF