rating system software and Windows-based hardware, Microsoft Office system, Microsoft SQL Server, and Microsoft Exchange Server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="464491">Microsoft Update</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1659578">Microsoft Update</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40423_2347704_2349767"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A request for response based on the French, Répondez s’il vous plaît.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2347704">RSVP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349767">RSVP (просьба адказаць)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40430_2347754_2349249"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service plan offer covering domestic calls as part of the PSTN Calling service in Office 365.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2347754">Skype for Business PSTN Domestic Calling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349249">Skype для бізнесу — выклікі ўнутры краіны праз PSTN</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40431_2347755_2349250"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service plan offer covering international calls as part of the PSTN Calling service in Office 365.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2347755">Skype for Business PSTN International Calling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349250">Skype для бізнесу — міжнародныя выклікі праз PSTN</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40432_2347756_2349248"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service plan offer covering domestic and international calls as part of the PSTN Calling service in Office 365.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2347756">Skype for Business PSTN Domestic and International Calling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349248">Skype для бізнесу — выклікі ўнутры краіны і міжнародныя выклікі праз PSTN</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40436_2349281_2352917"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu item showing hearts (number of likes) for a given chat message. The heart-feature refers to giving and removing hearts and is distinct from the Like-feature known from e.g. Facebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349281">Show likes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352917">Паказаць «Мне падабаецца»</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40438_2349283_2352918"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu item connected the heart-feature, whereby a participant can remove a "heart" from a chat message, indicating that the participant does not like a chat message. The heart-feature refers to giving and removing hearts and is distinct from the Like-feature known from e.g. Facebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349283">Unlike</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352918">Мне не падабаецца</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40439_2349284_2352912"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An amount of money added to an account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349284">credit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352912">крэдыт</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40440_2349285_2352914"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu item connected the heart-feature, whereby a participant can give a "heart" to a chat message, indicating that the participant likes a chat message. The heart-feature refers to giving and removing hearts and is distinct from the Like-feature known from e.g. Facebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349285">Like</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352914">Мне падабаецца</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40441_2349286_2352915"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list of hearts showing how many particpant have liked a chat message. The heart-feature refers to giving and removing hearts and is distinct from the Like-feature known from e.g. Facebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349286">Likes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352915">Спадабалася</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40475_2350858_2503201"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office servicing option in which new feature upgrades are available for installation right after they were first published by Microsoft.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2350858">Current Branch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2503201">Месячны канал</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40475_2350860_2503201"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office servicing option in which new feature upgrades are available for installation right after they were first published by Microsoft.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2350860">CB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2503201">Месячны канал</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40475_2364917_2503201"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office servicing option in which new feature upgrades are available for installation right after they were first published by Microsoft.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2364917">Current Channel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2503201">Месячны канал</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40476_2350861_2543935"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows servicing option in which new feature upgrades are available for installation around 4 months after they were first published by Microsoft and the minimum length of servicing lifetime is approximately 8 months.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2350861">Current Branch for Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2543935">Паўгадавы канал</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40476_2350862_2543935"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows servicing option in which new feature upgrades are available for installation around 4 months after they were first published by Microsoft and the minimum length of servicing lifetime is approximately 8 months.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2350862">CBB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2543935">Паўгадавы канал</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40476_2541062_2543935"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows servicing option in which new feature upgrades are available for installation around 4 months after they were first published by Microsoft and the minimum length of servicing lifetime is approximately 8 months.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2541062">Semi-Annual Channel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2543935">Паўгадавы канал</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40497_2352186_2353528"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature set that integrates data protection at the platform level so as to protect corporate data against inadvertent disclosure to unauthorized users and public services through email, social media and public cloud. It includes encryption of enterprise data when it enters the device or is created on the device, such that data stays protected against disclosure to applications and endpoints outside enterprise control.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352186">Enterprise data protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353528">EDP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40497_2352186_2353530"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature set that integrates data protection at the platform level so as to protect corporate data against inadvertent disclosure to unauthorized users and public services through email, social media and public cloud. It includes encryption of enterprise data when it enters the device or is created on the device, such that data stays protected against disclosure to applications and endpoints outside enterprise control.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352186">Enterprise data protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353530">Ахова карпаратыўных дадзеных</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40497_2352186_2405669"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature set that integrates data protection at the platform level so as to protect corporate data against inadvertent disclosure to unauthorized users and public services through email, social media and public cloud. It includes encryption of enterprise data when it enters the device or is created on the device, such that data stays protected against disclosure to applications and endpoints outside enterprise control.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2352186">Enterprise data protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2405669">Windows Information Protection</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><t