e number of deals have not been finalized (won or lost), as well as their sum.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488795">Deals active</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499573">Актыўныя здзелкі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44315_2489135_2499684"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for students and educators that includes the Universal Windows Platform versions of Excel, PowerPoint, and Word, and that allows shared computer activation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2489135">Office 365 Education Cart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499684">Office 365 Education Cart</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44329_2489211_2590030"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application available on devices you manage with Intune which is used to access company data to perform common tasks like enrolling devices, installing apps, and locating information for assistance from your IT department.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2489211">Intune Company Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2590030">Intune Company Portal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44329_2489211_2590094"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application available on devices you manage with Intune which is used to access company data to perform common tasks like enrolling devices, installing apps, and locating information for assistance from your IT department.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2489211">Intune Company Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2590094">Company Portal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44329_2490036_2590030"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application available on devices you manage with Intune which is used to access company data to perform common tasks like enrolling devices, installing apps, and locating information for assistance from your IT department.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490036">Company Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2590030">Intune Company Portal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44329_2490036_2590094"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application available on devices you manage with Intune which is used to access company data to perform common tasks like enrolling devices, installing apps, and locating information for assistance from your IT department.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490036">Company Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2590094">Company Portal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44349_2490693_2501455"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to select a later time to automatically deliver emails and where said emails are stored in the Drafts folder until the time selected for sending.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490693">Send Later</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2501455">Адправіць пазней</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44350_2490694_2503197"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The value that Excel returns when a formula returns an array of values and one or more of the cells it would spill to already has content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490694">#NOSPILL!</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2503197">#НЯМАПЕРАЦЯКАННЯ!</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44351_2490695_2501453"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The value that Excel returns when a function tried to connect to a network resource or a remote service but failed.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490695">#CONNECT!</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2501453">#ПАДЛУЧЭННЕ!</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44352_2490696_2503205"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Excel cell capability that allows a cell to place array values in neighboring blank cells.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490696">Spill</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2503205">Перацяканне</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44355_2493977_2511289"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A container for a collection of configuration settings file with extension .ppkg. Provisioning packages are simple enough that with a short set of written instructions, a student or non-technical employee can use them to configure their device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493977">provisioning package</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2511289">пакет падрыхтоўкі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44356_2493981_2511292"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The academic disciplines of science, technology, engineering and mathematics, used when addressing education policy and curriculum choices in schools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493981">STEM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2511292">інжынерна-тэхнічныя спецыяльнасці</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44357_2493985_2511287"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collaborative work space, tool, app, or program for making, learning, exploring and sharing. It can refer to a literal space or place, or to digital environments where people are encouraged to create and share with a community.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493985">makerspace</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2511287">майстроўня</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44358_2493987_2511284"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A test with important consequences for the test taker or which is the basis of a major decision.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493987">high-stakes testing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2511284">выніковы тэст</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44360_2496992_2503267"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The portal where admins in educational institutions can acquire and distribute apps for their students, faculty, and staff to use.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2496992">Microsoft Store for Education</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2503267">Microsoft Store для адукацыі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNo