d as default for the design of a SharePoint communication site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2608183">default hero</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2610674">стандартны галоўны банер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46325_2608792_2610673"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SharePoint site created or managed by few people to broadcast information out to a broad audience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2608792">communication site</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2610673">інфармацыйны сайт</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46330_2609539_2663773"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that enables Cortana to take over your mouse pointer and literally show you how to change a setting when you ask her to "show me (how to do something)." She performs each step for you in a sequence of clicks needed to make a particular change in Windows Settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2609539">Cortana Show Me</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2663773">Cortana Show Me</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46331_2609624_2611131"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The downloadable tool that runs a series of tests to diagnose and help fix problems with Surface hardware.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2609624">Surface Diagnostic Toolkit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2611131">Інструментарый дыягностыкі Surface</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46337_2609835_2785712"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To plan an event for a specific time slot.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2609835">schedule</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2785712">запланаваць</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46341_2610077_2611128"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The consumer-facing name for Hypervisor Code Integrity (HVCI). The HVCI service in Windows 10 determines whether code executing in kernel mode is securely designed and trustworthy, and helps ensure that all software running in kernel mode, including drivers, securely allocate memory and operate as they are intended.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2610077">memory integrity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2611128">цэласнасць памяці</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46344_2834959_2836562"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The desktop-only sync app for OneDrive that enables on-demand file sharing and navigation in File Explorer and that comes pre-installed on PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2834959">Microsoft OneDrive sync</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2836562">Сінхранізацыя Microsoft OneDrive</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46344_2834959_2836569"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The desktop-only sync app for OneDrive that enables on-demand file sharing and navigation in File Explorer and that comes pre-installed on PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2834959">Microsoft OneDrive sync</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2836569">Сінхранізацыя OneDrive</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46344_2834960_2836562"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The desktop-only sync app for OneDrive that enables on-demand file sharing and navigation in File Explorer and that comes pre-installed on PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2834960">OneDrive sync</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2836562">Сінхранізацыя Microsoft OneDrive</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46344_2834960_2836569"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The desktop-only sync app for OneDrive that enables on-demand file sharing and navigation in File Explorer and that comes pre-installed on PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2834960">OneDrive sync</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2836569">Сінхранізацыя OneDrive</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4635_318145_1573385"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any combination of keys that must be pressed sequentially.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318145">access key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1573385">клавіша доступу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4635_318145_2296753"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any combination of keys that must be pressed sequentially.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318145">access key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2296753">паслядоўнасць клавіш</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4635_72848_1573385"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any combination of keys that must be pressed sequentially.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="72848">key sequence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1573385">клавіша доступу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4635_72848_2296753"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any combination of