e, provides recommendations on how to configure features in a way that reduces the attack surface without interrupting critical workflows, and that provides supporting data on feature usage and security risk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2671644">Security Policy Advisor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2766121">SPA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46554_2764076_2673326"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that analyzes clients' usage, provides recommendations on how to configure features in a way that reduces the attack surface without interrupting critical workflows, and that provides supporting data on feature usage and security risk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2764076">SPA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673326">Дарадца па палітыцы бяспекі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46554_2764076_2766121"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that analyzes clients' usage, provides recommendations on how to configure features in a way that reduces the attack surface without interrupting critical workflows, and that provides supporting data on feature usage and security risk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2764076">SPA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2766121">SPA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46556_2619828_2623886"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office add-in that helps users learn how to use JavaScript APIs by allowing them to create and edit JavaScript, HTML, and CSS within Word, Excel, and PowerPoint, giving them references to libraries and data on the web, and allowing them to run the code and see the result in a task pane within the Office application.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619828">Script Lab</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2623886">Script Lab</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46562_2619851_2623847"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of Microsoft 365 services that features that deal with content analysis and enhancements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619851">Office Transformation Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2623847">Office Transformation Service</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46568_2620200_2622644"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person who is under the age of full legal responsibility.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2620200">minor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2622644">непаўналетняя асоба</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46572_2620841_2636763"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Premium service that allows users to publish a Sway from within Word.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2620841">Print to Web</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2636763">Публікацыя ў інтэрнэце</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46572_2707490_2636763"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Premium service that allows users to publish a Sway from within Word.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2707490">Transform to Web</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote