 feature that allows managers to manage and share scheduling and that allows firstline workers to view their schedules and make scheduling requests.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2681124">Shifts</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2682441">Змены</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47640_2681124_2688415"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Teams feature that allows managers to manage and share scheduling and that allows firstline workers to view their schedules and make scheduling requests.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2681124">Shifts</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2688415">Расклад</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47641_2681125_2682443"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Teams feature that allows users to create and assign tasks at the individual and team level and that allows end users to review completed tasks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2681125">Tasks</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2682443">Задачы</t