 365 Admin Center, a score that shows how network connectivity impacts user experience allowing for comparison of different user location network connections.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816685">network performance score</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2821753">ацэнка сеткі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49812_2816686_2821749"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Microsoft 365 Admin Center, a score that shows how network connectivity impacts user experience allowing for comparison of different user location network connections.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816686">network score</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2821749">ацэнка прадукцыйнасці сеткі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49812_2816686_2821753"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Microsoft 365 Admin Center, a score that shows how network connectivity impacts user experience allowing for comparison of different user location network connections.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816686">network score</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2821753">ацэнка сеткі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49813_2816693_2821762"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A regular expression pattern used to specify the maximum number of tokens that might occur between desired search terms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816693">proximity pattern</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2821762">шаблон з улікам блізкасці</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49814_2816699_2821735"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To forward an urgent message to another person.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816699">escalate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2821735">перанакіраваць</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49815_2816700_2821737"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Skype status that allows notifications only for urgent messages and from priority contacts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816700">focusing</t