d to show an overview of the user's schedule, tasks and frequent contacts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="184170">To-Do Bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1864375">Спіс спраў</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5859_293097_2011705"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A unique number governments issue to companies and citizens in order to track taxes paid on goods and services. VAT IDs in the European Union contain a country prefix followed by up to 12 digits or characters.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="293097">VAT ID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2011705">ІНП</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">BLR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5874_101275_1864154"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A form of statistical analysis used for forecasting. Regression analysis estimates the relationship between variables so that a given variable can be predicted from one or more other variables.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="101275">regression analysis</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="be"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1864154">рэгрэсійны аналіз</ter